1
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,210
♪ We'll follow Zhang Xie to the capital ♪

2
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:24,390
♪ Lest he prove untrue
and leave us heartbroken ♪

3
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,320
This southern opera
is being performed tonight

4
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:33,250
♪ Today Zhang Xie rides through
the streets in triumph ♪

5
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:34,560
to welcome you into the household.

6
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,100
♪ But he's short of helping hands ♪

7
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,600
Back then, your mother

8
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,310
♪ Let's go lend him ours ♪

9
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,470
loved this piece the most as well.

10
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:42,850
♪ The ghosts will bear the sedan chair ♪

11
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,750
♪ The gods will blow the trumpets ♪

12
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:09,360
♪ Decked in red and clad in green ♪

13
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:03,370
When I was young, I lived
alone and destitute far from home,

14
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:05,530
growing up among the common folk.

15
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:08,480
My birth mother once committed
a grave mistake

16
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,100
and harmed her family.

17
00:01:19,039 --> 00:01:20,120
But was my mother

18
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:23,070
truly a sinner?

19
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:28,480
My mother had once entered the grand gates
of the Xie Residence full of hope.

20
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,840
Yet behind those vermilion gates...

21
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,430
A lowly actress like you

22
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:34,680
isn't worthy of living in Danyue Pavilion!

23
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:37,870
-Help! Concubine Xia's been murdered!
-In the end, my mother

24
00:01:37,870 --> 00:01:39,850
was accused of murder.

25
00:01:40,870 --> 00:01:43,200
Our Xie family's century-old reputation

26
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:46,509
will not be sullied
by a vile, treacherous woman like you.

27
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:48,000
After that,

28
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:50,120
my mother chose to bear the shame

29
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:52,000
and leave the Xie Residence

30
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,600
with me still in her womb.

31
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:57,280
She and I depended on each other.

32
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,039
Our life was humble,

33
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,770
but we were content.

34
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,920
Yet even so,

35
00:02:04,310 --> 00:02:05,310
there were still those in the Xie family

36
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:07,310
who refused to leave us in peace.

37
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,430
Years later,

38
00:02:20,470 --> 00:02:22,310
Grandmother brought me back
to the Xie Residence.

39
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,110
[Qingyuan]

40
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,460
And that was when Xie Qingyuan's life

41
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,400
truly began.

42
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:37,310
[Spring of The Blade]

43
00:02:37,650 --> 00:02:40,370
[Episode 1]

44
00:02:49,250 --> 00:02:51,230
[One Month Ago]

45
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:55,640
[Chen Yunya]

46
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,310
My Lady.

47
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,280
Everything's ready.

48
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,430
Then all we need is an opportunity.

49
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,460
Now that the stage's been set,

50
00:03:05,590 --> 00:03:06,280
it's time

51
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:08,080
for the show to begin.

52
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:46,840
Attack!

53
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,560
Who do you think you are?

54
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,300
This grain is disaster relief
sent by imperial decree.

55
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:56,440
Do you all have a death wish?

56
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,520
We can't get into the city!

57
00:03:57,520 --> 00:04:00,520
If we don't seize this grain,
we have no way to survive!

58
00:04:00,670 --> 00:04:01,730
Where's the grain?

59
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,030
Guards!

60
00:04:06,350 --> 00:04:08,550
Drive them to the outskirts of the city!

61
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:28,440
[Wei Changyan,
Jiangnan Transport Commissioner]

62
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:31,290
Greetings, My Lord. I'm Wei Changyan,
Jiangnan Transport Commissioner.

63
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,360
Hengtang is quite lively, isn't it?

64
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:37,870
I'm temporarily overseeing
affairs in Hengtang.

65
00:04:37,870 --> 00:04:39,070
I've failed in my duties

66
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:42,070
and allowed these refugees
to disturb Your Lordship.

67
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:43,420
It is my fault.

68
00:04:48,290 --> 00:04:51,070
[Yan Rui, Imperial Advisor
of the Ministry of Revenue]

69
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:55,050
[Outskirts of Hengtang City]

70
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:59,050
Is this supposed to be boiling water
or making porridge?

71
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:01,680
How many grains of rice are in there?

72
00:05:02,310 --> 00:05:03,770
I don't see a single grain.

73
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:06,120
He's just boiling plain water.

74
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:08,270
They should have at least brought
half a cart of grain

75
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:09,870
to tide us over for a few days.

76
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:11,210
This corrupt official

77
00:05:11,490 --> 00:05:14,710
didn't even bother bringing
a single grain of rice.

78
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,430
Lord Wei, you look a bit gloomy.

79
00:05:18,870 --> 00:05:20,600
You're not upset
that I borrowed your grain

80
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,530
for relief distribution, are you?

81
00:05:22,950 --> 00:05:23,950
I wouldn't dare.

82
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,270
It's just that today's porridge

83
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:27,720
is indeed a bit thin.

84
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:31,680
I'll have to trouble you to
bring more rice tomorrow, Lord Wei.

85
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,270
Yes.

86
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,000
My Lord.

87
00:05:34,159 --> 00:05:35,420
The porridge is ready.

88
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:41,870
Everyone,

89
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,300
the porridge is ready.

90
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,890
Come and get your porridge.

91
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:51,320
No rush. No rush.

92
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,510
One at a time.

93
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:53,630
Take it easy.

94
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:55,490
There's enough for everyone.

95
00:05:55,510 --> 00:05:56,750
I know

96
00:05:57,390 --> 00:05:59,070
you all must feel

97
00:05:59,310 --> 00:06:01,270
very grateful to me right now.

98
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:03,480
I bear the imperial decree,

99
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,000
so in handling disaster relief,

100
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,600
I'll certainly do my utmost.

101
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,660
Easy, easy.

102
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,610
There's enough for everyone.

103
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:11,920
Let's go.

104
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,280
We still have important matters
to attend to.

105
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,190
Let's not cause any trouble.

106
00:06:15,190 --> 00:06:16,920
One by one, no rush.

107
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,490
Is it my turn yet?

108
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,820
Please, I haven't gotten any yet!

109
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,750
Me. Me first.

110
00:06:25,750 --> 00:06:26,920
I'm starving.

111
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,180
You corrupt official!

112
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,000
Protect His Lordship! Hurry!

113
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,360
Protect His Lordship!

114
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:40,930
Don't run! Catch him!

115
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,340
Stop there!

116
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:43,500
Are you alright, My Lord?

117
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:44,100
I'm fine.

118
00:06:44,650 --> 00:06:45,650
Don't run!

119
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,800
Freeze!

120
00:06:53,470 --> 00:06:54,150
Stop!

121
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:55,430
Stop!

122
00:07:01,510 --> 00:07:03,040
-Let go of me!
-My Lady.

123
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,440
The road's blocked.

124
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:12,550
Do whatever you want to me!

125
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:15,800
-I won't beg for mercy!
-You seem to have a problem with me.

126
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,430
I originally thought that

127
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:20,830
since you came all the way
from the capital,

128
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:22,430
you must be someone
who actually gets things done.

129
00:07:22,430 --> 00:07:24,270
Who would have thought
that you're even more hateful,

130
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:25,270
more despicable,

131
00:07:25,390 --> 00:07:27,000
and more disgusting than them!

132
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,650
You live in luxury, sparing no expense
on your own food and clothes,

133
00:07:28,650 --> 00:07:30,040
yet there's not a grain of relief rice
for the people!

134
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:32,110
Not a single grain!

135
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,360
Are you done?

136
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,800
I know you've suffered a lot.

137
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,510
So trust me.

138
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,950
I came this time

139
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:50,400
specifically to...

140
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,840
Such an exquisite item.

141
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:14,390
From now on,

142
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:16,790
whenever you see me,

143
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,520
keep your distance.

144
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:31,320
[Xie Residence in Hengtang]

145
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:35,910
[Danyue Pavilion]

146
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,520
[An official robe, a burial mound.
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.]

147
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:45,030
[Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.]

148
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,670
A letter from the Northern Frontier!

149
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:49,730
A letter from the Northern Frontier!

150
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:54,080
What on earth happened?

151
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,710
How did he end up

152
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,790
offending the royal family?

153
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:58,540
Nonsense.

154
00:09:59,550 --> 00:10:01,150
Bothering Mother like this.

155
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,520
My poor son, Zhenglun...

156
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:12,480
He's been guarding that bitterly cold
Northern Frontier

157
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,840
for years,

158
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,660
and now he actually has to
suffer this calamity.

159
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,780
[Old Madam Xie]

160
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:20,440
Serving as an official in the court

161
00:10:20,670 --> 00:10:22,030
always comes with rises and falls.

162
00:10:21,470 --> 00:10:23,160
[Hu Wenzhuo,
Head Madam of the Xie Family]

163
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,960
Things like this happen.

164
00:10:23,590 --> 00:10:25,270
[Lian Fanqiao,
Third Concubine of the Xie Family]

165
00:10:24,510 --> 00:10:26,910
It won't shake the century-old foundations

166
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:28,750
of our Xie family.

167
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:31,670
How can we panic and lose our composure

168
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,910
over just a minor hardship?

169
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:34,000
[Mei Yinghua,
Second Concubine of the Xie Family]

170
00:10:35,390 --> 00:10:37,240
Especially you.

171
00:10:37,550 --> 00:10:39,840
As the head madam of the Xie household,

172
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,840
you've lost your composure—

173
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:45,460
how can you ever be entrusted
with greater responsibilities?

174
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:49,130
Your reprimand is justified, Old Madam.

175
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,440
But there is one thing

176
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,240
I

177
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:54,160
must bring up nonetheless.

178
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,040
A blood-written poem

179
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,720
suddenly appeared at Danyue Pavilion

180
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,480
a few months ago,

181
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:00,270
[An official robe, a burial mound.
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.]

182
00:11:00,290 --> 00:11:01,110
[Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.]

183
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,120
saying things like

184
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:05,630
Old Madam would be ill for a long time
without recovery,

185
00:11:05,630 --> 00:11:07,760
Master would be demoted for no reason,

186
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:15,280
[Danyue Pavilion]

187
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:09,790
and that the others in the household

188
00:11:09,790 --> 00:11:11,520
would also suffer misfortune.

189
00:11:12,310 --> 00:11:14,840
An official robe, a burial mound.

190
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:18,300
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.

191
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:21,370
Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.

192
00:11:21,470 --> 00:11:24,510
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.

193
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:28,480
I entered the Xie household at 19,

194
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:30,870
and I've spent my life
managing the trading house,

195
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:32,470
keeping the inner household in order,

196
00:11:32,470 --> 00:11:35,270
and dealing with all manner of
demons and schemes—

197
00:11:35,670 --> 00:11:37,000
what manner of specter

198
00:11:37,270 --> 00:11:38,320
have I not seen?

199
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:39,320
And now

200
00:11:39,750 --> 00:11:42,390
you little rats think you can frighten me?

201
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,130
Go and assign people

202
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,510
to recite the Kṣitigarbha Sutra
in the ancestral hall

203
00:11:46,510 --> 00:11:47,720
around the clock.

204
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,030
Let's see whether

205
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:53,840
you vicious ghosts are more fearsome,

206
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:58,300
or whether the ancestral tablets
of our Xie family carry greater weight!

207
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,080
Zhengjun!

208
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:00,600
Go and douse it

209
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,200
with dog blood!

210
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:03,510
Me?

211
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,540
[Xie Zhengjun,
Second Young Master of the Xie Family]

212
00:12:19,870 --> 00:12:20,670
Young Master!

213
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,120
You bastard!

214
00:12:26,270 --> 00:12:27,470
You're finally back!

215
00:12:27,630 --> 00:12:29,790
You might as well come back tomorrow
and collect my corpse!

216
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:31,790
Young Master, black dog blood
isn't easy to get.

217
00:12:31,790 --> 00:12:32,750
The butcher at the market

218
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:33,390
had to slaughter one fresh.

219
00:12:33,390 --> 00:12:34,720
It's been 2 whole hours.

220
00:12:34,870 --> 00:12:36,600
In that amount of time, even ghosts
could've reincarnated 3 times over!

221
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,360
Do you have any idea what I went through?

222
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,080
I do, I do.

223
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:40,600
Please stop complaining.

224
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:42,330
-Just splash it.
-Give it to me.

225
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,120
What's that sound?

226
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,030
You heard it?

227
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,150
I didn't.

228
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:50,080
I...

229
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,410
I didn't hear anything.

230
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:52,790
That's not right.

231
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:53,960
That's not right.

232
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:54,910
What's that sound?

233
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:55,910
Did you hear that?

234
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,840
Wufu?

235
00:12:57,150 --> 00:12:57,960
Wufu!

236
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:48,550
Yunya.

237
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:49,920
Stop singing.

238
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,690
Let alone Xie Zhengjun,

239
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:53,390
even I, who am playing a ghost,

240
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:55,390
am about to be scared to death by you.

241
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:58,670
That's exactly what I want—
every one of them to live in fear,

242
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:00,530
their minds thrown into turmoil.

243
00:14:01,790 --> 00:14:04,190
Mere sleepless nights are far from enough.

244
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:07,080
I want them to feel as if 10,000 arrows
were piercing their hearts.

245
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:09,740
Your Yunduo has been selected
by the Xie family.

246
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:10,960
This afternoon,

247
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,550
it was taken into the Xie Residence

248
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:14,410
along with several other horses.

249
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:18,550
Favorable conditions
have appeared in Hengtang.

250
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:21,150
It's time we made use of them.

251
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:32,470
Fire!

252
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:33,790
Hurry and help put out the fire!

253
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:35,520
Hurry and help put out the fire!

254
00:14:36,530 --> 00:14:37,290
Fire!

255
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,120
Fire!

256
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:39,200
Help!

257
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:40,170
Fire!

258
00:14:40,190 --> 00:14:40,720
Fire!

259
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:41,610
Help!

260
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:42,850
Fire!

261
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:44,790
The curse.

262
00:14:47,810 --> 00:14:48,960
[Blazing flames]

263
00:14:51,420 --> 00:14:53,670
[Crimson eyes]

264
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,550
It's the curse.

265
00:14:57,270 --> 00:14:58,600
The curse has come true!

266
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:02,650
Old Madam!

267
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:03,550
Old Madam!

268
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,650
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

269
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:06,280
The curse has come true!

270
00:15:07,150 --> 00:15:08,270
Nonsense.

271
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,360
Old Madam!

272
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,320
Old Madam!

273
00:15:10,390 --> 00:15:11,100
Old Madam!

274
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:12,020
Old Madam!

275
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,700
-The fire has spread to the east wing!
-Fire!

276
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,600
Quick, go bring the fire brigade!

277
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:19,440
Old Madam.

278
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:21,150
It's the vengeful spirits
coming to claim lives.

279
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:22,600
The vengeful spirits are here
to claim lives!

280
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,480
Shut up!

281
00:15:24,350 --> 00:15:25,610
Help put out the fire!

282
00:15:26,910 --> 00:15:28,660
Help! Put out the fire!

283
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:31,560
Amitabha.

284
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:39,470
Fire!

285
00:15:39,490 --> 00:15:40,750
Help!

286
00:15:48,630 --> 00:15:49,720
Zuixian Tavern is truly great.

287
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,910
Let's drink till we drop again
another day!

288
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:53,240
Let's drink to our heart's content again!

289
00:15:57,050 --> 00:15:59,090
Something bad happened! Help!

290
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,030
Protect Lord Yan!

291
00:16:00,860 --> 00:16:01,550
[Zuixian Tavern]

292
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:02,290
Protect Lord Yan!

293
00:16:03,390 --> 00:16:03,960
My Lord!

294
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:05,440
My Lord!

295
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:06,960
My Lord!

296
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:08,000
Stop!

297
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:09,970
[Zuixian Tavern]

298
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,240
My Lord, something bad happened!

299
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,390
There's a fire over there!

300
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:11,440
Where?

301
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:13,630
It seems to be the Xie Residence.

302
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:14,910
The Xie Residence?

303
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,390
Lord Guo, quick, quick.

304
00:16:16,390 --> 00:16:17,550
A fire is a serious matter.

305
00:16:17,550 --> 00:16:18,670
Go help put it out!

306
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:19,790
Yes. Got it.

307
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:20,960
I will take my leave.

308
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:22,750
Quick! Quick!

309
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:23,120
See you.

310
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:23,720
This way!

311
00:16:27,910 --> 00:16:28,670
This way.

312
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:30,220
Follow them.

313
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:30,720
Yes.

314
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,670
Once it's burned down,

315
00:16:47,670 --> 00:16:49,200
it'll be your turn to beg me.

316
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:52,340
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

317
00:16:52,690 --> 00:16:53,960
Water's here!

318
00:16:56,270 --> 00:16:57,270
Get out of the way!

319
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,540
Move! Move!

320
00:16:58,870 --> 00:17:00,100
Hurry up!

321
00:17:03,630 --> 00:17:04,960
Quick, quick! Hurry up!

322
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:06,960
Follow up!

323
00:17:07,030 --> 00:17:07,680
Be quick!

324
00:17:07,819 --> 00:17:08,470
Hurry up!

325
00:17:08,490 --> 00:17:09,000
Hurry!

326
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,930
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

327
00:17:42,590 --> 00:17:43,400
Yunduo!

328
00:17:58,090 --> 00:17:59,400
Young lady.

329
00:18:01,150 --> 00:18:02,700
Is this the one you're calling for?

330
00:18:02,700 --> 00:18:04,100
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

331
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:06,870
Stop there.

332
00:18:14,350 --> 00:18:16,410
What are your instructions, My Lord?

333
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:19,770
Since you know who I am,

334
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:22,440
and your horse almost hurt me,

335
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,460
how should we settle this?

336
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:26,480
This is not my horse.

337
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:29,210
Then whose name is Yunduo?

338
00:18:29,350 --> 00:18:30,280
I just made it up.

339
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:36,240
I have heard

340
00:18:36,270 --> 00:18:37,590
that some horses are easily startled

341
00:18:37,590 --> 00:18:38,850
and fierce-tempered,

342
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:41,240
and only their owner's whistle
can calm them down.

343
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:41,670
[Zuixian Tavern]

344
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:46,330
As for the fire at the Xie Residence,

345
00:18:46,330 --> 00:18:49,530
I'm afraid you can't
escape responsibility for it, lady.

346
00:18:54,190 --> 00:18:56,860
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

347
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,190
You hid flint

348
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,740
inside sugared balls

349
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:02,730
and tied them to the horse.

350
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:05,030
Once the sugar melted,
the fire was ignited.

351
00:19:05,030 --> 00:19:06,960
And with the east wind blowing strong,

352
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,760
the flames spread with the wind,

353
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:11,450
while the evidence was destroyed
along with it.

354
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:15,620
Quite an intricately orchestrated
scheme you devised, lady.

355
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:22,840
And where did you get that whistle, lady?

356
00:19:23,350 --> 00:19:26,680
Come to think of it, that should
count as physical evidence.

357
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:41,790
First arson,

358
00:19:41,790 --> 00:19:43,510
then destruction of evidence—

359
00:19:43,510 --> 00:19:45,830
do you believe I could arrest you
right now?

360
00:19:45,830 --> 00:19:46,630
Go ahead then.

361
00:19:49,310 --> 00:19:50,720
Your Lordship gave me the chance

362
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:51,920
to destroy the evidence just now

363
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,380
and did nothing to stop me.

364
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:55,310
By that logic,

365
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:57,370
you'd be an accomplice as well.

366
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,110
Besides,

367
00:19:58,480 --> 00:19:59,830
with Your Lordship's abilities,

368
00:19:59,830 --> 00:20:02,640
capturing a weak woman like me
would have been effortless.

369
00:20:02,640 --> 00:20:05,240
If you truly intended to act, you would've
arrested me from the start.

370
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:07,310
Why go through all this step by step,
pressing me like this?

371
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:09,350
Your Lordship clearly
has some other motive—

372
00:20:09,350 --> 00:20:11,550
one you don't want others to know about.

373
00:20:24,830 --> 00:20:26,110
Who exactly are you?

374
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:29,160
And what do you want with the Xie family?

375
00:20:32,030 --> 00:20:33,400
I'll get to the bottom of it.

376
00:20:33,250 --> 00:20:37,600
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

377
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:43,470
[The Wondrous Being of the Great Void]

378
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:50,600
When heaven and earth
reverse their course

379
00:20:50,790 --> 00:20:52,510
and old debts return
in the cycle of reincarnation,

380
00:20:52,510 --> 00:20:54,450
this is the manifestation of
karmic retribution—

381
00:20:54,450 --> 00:20:56,380
something that cannot be avoided.

382
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:58,920
What are we supposed to do now?

383
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:02,590
Master is about to return
from the Northern Frontier,

384
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:04,110
yet the household is in chaos—

385
00:21:04,110 --> 00:21:04,790
first the fire,

386
00:21:04,790 --> 00:21:06,140
then the hauntings,

387
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:08,200
and now the talk of karmic retribution.

388
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:10,280
Are they determined to see us dead?

389
00:21:10,820 --> 00:21:13,530
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

390
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:20,900
Take these scriptures

391
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:22,890
to the ancestral hall and burn them.

392
00:21:22,890 --> 00:21:23,590
Yes.

393
00:21:26,510 --> 00:21:27,530
How did it go?

394
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:31,030
Did the Taoist priest
have any way to deal with this?

395
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:32,660
The Taoist priest hinted

396
00:21:33,030 --> 00:21:35,160
that the last line of
the blood-written poem...

397
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:36,690
Please do not worry, Madam.

398
00:21:37,110 --> 00:21:38,910
You must understand that all things
in this world

399
00:21:38,910 --> 00:21:41,060
[The Profound Realm of True Mystery]

400
00:21:39,110 --> 00:21:41,400
follow the principle of
mutual generation and restraint.

401
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,730
Fortune and misfortune

402
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,220
are ever intertwined.

403
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:46,640
Now that calamity has befallen you,

404
00:21:47,160 --> 00:21:49,290
there is surely a mascot to ward it off.

405
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:51,110
A mascot to ward it off?

406
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:53,400
I have said all I can.

407
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:53,370
[The Profound Realm of True Mystery]

408
00:21:53,430 --> 00:21:55,650
[An official robe, a burial mound.
Blazing flames light up crimson eyes.]

409
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,350
A child, at last,

410
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:57,890
[Iron hooves crush blood beneath the gate.
A child, at last, pays the price of fate.]

411
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,180
pays the price of fate.

412
00:21:57,590 --> 00:21:59,590
One of the children of the Xie family

413
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,330
will definitely be able

414
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:03,210
to resolve this predicament.

415
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:07,110
It's just that if anything were to happen

416
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:09,370
to one of our Xie family's children...

417
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:12,440
I'm worried you wouldn't be able
to bear it, Old Madam.

418
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:20,510
I've actually

419
00:22:21,350 --> 00:22:24,000
heard some rumors recently,

420
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:25,830
about Jin Chunqing

421
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:28,110
giving birth to a child

422
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:31,290
after she left our residence years ago...

423
00:22:42,310 --> 00:22:43,160
Take a seat.

424
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:44,790
Yes.

425
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,070
Wenzhuo.

426
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:53,720
Yes?

427
00:22:54,550 --> 00:22:55,560
You and I

428
00:22:57,070 --> 00:22:58,680
share the same thought.

429
00:23:02,030 --> 00:23:02,920
Old Madam!

430
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:06,960
Old Madam.

431
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,790
We've found that child.

432
00:23:18,710 --> 00:23:20,800
[Welcoming Heaven's Blessings]

433
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:55,160
What would you like to buy?

434
00:24:04,310 --> 00:24:04,790
Wait.

435
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:07,260
Yunya isn't some object

436
00:24:07,550 --> 00:24:10,260
you can just move around as you please.

437
00:24:10,590 --> 00:24:11,400
Old Madam Xie.

438
00:24:11,790 --> 00:24:14,000
Recognizing family ties
is a big deal, right?

439
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:16,000
I have to respect her wishes on this.

440
00:24:16,110 --> 00:24:17,070
Please

441
00:24:17,070 --> 00:24:18,510
go back for today.

442
00:24:18,590 --> 00:24:20,520
And take all these things with you.

443
00:24:20,790 --> 00:24:22,290
We're a humble household—

444
00:24:22,550 --> 00:24:24,750
we have no use for such lavish gifts.

445
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,770
You and Yunya are not blood relatives,

446
00:24:28,550 --> 00:24:31,480
but you raised her for our Xie family
all these years.

447
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:33,110
No gift could be too generous

448
00:24:33,270 --> 00:24:34,720
for you to accept.

449
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:36,550
Still,

450
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,880
I respect your wishes.

451
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:42,480
After all, one should never forcefully

452
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:45,350
keep what does not belong to them.

453
00:24:46,550 --> 00:24:49,880
To do so would defy
heaven and moral order,

454
00:24:50,350 --> 00:24:52,720
and invite misfortune.

455
00:24:53,830 --> 00:24:56,070
Even though Yunya and I
are not blood relatives,

456
00:24:56,070 --> 00:24:57,240
she's still the girl our Chen family

457
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:59,930
raised and cherished from childhood.

458
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:02,110
How dare you think
you can just take her away?

459
00:25:02,110 --> 00:25:03,240
I'm telling you now,

460
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:05,350
whatever tricks you have up your sleeve,

461
00:25:05,350 --> 00:25:07,510
I'll meet you head-on.

462
00:25:09,590 --> 00:25:10,920
Granny, don't.

463
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:28,160
Good child.

464
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:33,240
I'm your grandmother.

465
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:35,550
Come.

466
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:37,030
Come here.

467
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:39,240
Let me take a good look at you.

468
00:25:43,750 --> 00:25:44,400
Dear!

469
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,560
Don't take another step!

470
00:25:47,310 --> 00:25:48,720
If you take one more step,

471
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:51,960
our Chen family will disown you
as our granddaughter.

472
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,280
Come here.

473
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:24,480
Granny.

474
00:26:25,750 --> 00:26:26,640
I'm sorry.

475
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:33,600
I'm grateful for all you've done
in raising me,

476
00:26:37,070 --> 00:26:39,070
but I want to return to my own family.

477
00:26:43,030 --> 00:26:44,590
I want to see my father.

478
00:26:56,070 --> 00:26:56,670
Very well.

479
00:26:57,880 --> 00:27:00,210
You want to return to
your own family, huh?

480
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:01,480
Very well.

481
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:03,640
So very well!

482
00:27:04,350 --> 00:27:05,620
If you return to your family,

483
00:27:05,620 --> 00:27:07,420
then don't come back ever again!

484
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:17,410
Good girl.

485
00:27:18,030 --> 00:27:19,550
Once you're packed,

486
00:27:20,030 --> 00:27:22,290
I'll send someone to come and pick you up.

487
00:27:22,590 --> 00:27:25,530
I'll make sure you come back
to the Xie family in glory

488
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:27,630
and that

489
00:27:28,070 --> 00:27:29,620
you rightfully become

490
00:27:30,550 --> 00:27:32,470
the Fourth Lady of the Xie family.

491
00:27:39,270 --> 00:27:41,120
Raise the sedan!

492
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:16,000
This is as far as I can help you.

493
00:28:16,550 --> 00:28:18,080
For the rest of the journey,

494
00:28:18,790 --> 00:28:20,920
you'll have to forge ahead on your own.

495
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:30,740
The fire at the Xie Residence
was quite suspicious.

496
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:31,350
By the way,

497
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:33,350
Your Lordship asked me to investigate
the owner of the white horse,

498
00:28:33,350 --> 00:28:34,680
and I've got some clues.

499
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:36,800
That woman's name is Chen Yunya.

500
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:39,590
She's the granddaughter of
the owner of Chen's Tea House.

501
00:28:39,590 --> 00:28:41,030
She has a close friend from Jingzhou,

502
00:28:41,030 --> 00:28:42,160
named Dong Fangchun,

503
00:28:42,160 --> 00:28:43,750
who seems to have considerable influence
in the martial world.

504
00:28:43,750 --> 00:28:45,200
The two of them frequent Baiyun Temple,

505
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,790
and they share a very close relationship

506
00:28:46,790 --> 00:28:47,960
with a Taoist named Xin Zhen.

507
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,350
Dong Fangchun and Xin Zhen
conspired together,

508
00:28:49,350 --> 00:28:51,000
using the pretense of
performing ritual ceremonies

509
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:52,590
to carry out thefts targeting
wealthy households and local gentry.

510
00:28:52,590 --> 00:28:55,720
They've committed crimes in places
such as Yunzhou and Jingzhou.

511
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:56,920
Dong Fangchun is currently in Hengtang,

512
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,510
running a horse-selling business.

513
00:28:58,510 --> 00:28:59,550
That white horse was

514
00:28:59,550 --> 00:29:00,620
mixed in with other horses

515
00:29:00,620 --> 00:29:02,270
and sold to the Xie family at that time.

516
00:29:02,270 --> 00:29:03,730
And what about Chen Yunya?

517
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,560
Chen Yunya's background

518
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:07,280
is actually quite clean.

519
00:29:07,790 --> 00:29:09,640
She grew up at Chen's Tea House
from a young age.

520
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:11,640
There's nothing special about her,

521
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,570
except for her origins.

522
00:29:17,680 --> 00:29:18,550
Her origins?

523
00:29:19,630 --> 00:29:20,720
Chen Yunya is originally

524
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:22,920
the youngest daughter of the Xie family
who lived away from home.

525
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:24,790
After that big fire at the Xie Residence
a few days ago,

526
00:29:24,790 --> 00:29:25,790
for some reason,

527
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,310
Old Madam Xie
personally arranged everything

528
00:29:27,310 --> 00:29:28,920
and insisted on bringing her back
to the household.

529
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:29,920
This is the place.

530
00:29:35,940 --> 00:29:36,300
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

531
00:29:38,590 --> 00:29:40,680
What a long-lost Fourth Lady.

532
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:44,510
The Xie family must be connected to
the embezzlement case.

533
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,790
Then this Fourth Lady

534
00:29:45,830 --> 00:29:49,270
has actually become the key to
my investigation into the Xie family.

535
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:49,960
Sir,

536
00:29:50,310 --> 00:29:52,270
please enjoy the pear blossom candy
and Tiny Tip green tea.

537
00:29:52,270 --> 00:29:53,600
Have as much as you like.

538
00:29:53,680 --> 00:29:55,450
If you want anything else,

539
00:29:55,640 --> 00:29:57,160
just let me know at any time.

540
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:58,220
Thank you, Granny.

541
00:30:16,310 --> 00:30:17,000
Granny,

542
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,960
you've been running this tea house

543
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:21,560
for quite some years, right?

544
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:25,220
I've spent more than half of my life

545
00:30:25,350 --> 00:30:27,490
in this little tea house.

546
00:30:37,070 --> 00:30:39,070
Do you have any other pastries here?

547
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:40,410
Sure.

548
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:42,190
We have almond crisp,

549
00:30:42,270 --> 00:30:44,390
steamed flower cake, perilla candy,

550
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:45,680
and many other kinds.

551
00:30:48,590 --> 00:30:49,550
What are you steaming?

552
00:30:49,550 --> 00:30:50,550
It smells so good.

553
00:30:51,510 --> 00:30:54,350
This is my secret-recipe poria cake.

554
00:30:55,030 --> 00:30:56,880
You won't find it anywhere else.

555
00:30:58,590 --> 00:30:59,160
Alright.

556
00:30:59,550 --> 00:31:00,680
Give me one serving.

557
00:31:02,480 --> 00:31:04,360
Well, Sir,

558
00:31:04,510 --> 00:31:06,360
it's not done steaming yet.

559
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:07,960
Sir,

560
00:31:08,510 --> 00:31:10,040
you look quite unfamiliar.

561
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:14,400
Judging by your accent,
you're not from around here, are you?

562
00:31:15,890 --> 00:31:16,810
My name is Yan.

563
00:31:17,260 --> 00:31:19,720
I just arrived in Hengtang
from the capital.

564
00:31:21,310 --> 00:31:23,020
The capital's nice.

565
00:31:23,220 --> 00:31:25,240
Our city is small in comparison.

566
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:28,480
Are you getting used to living here?

567
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:31,700
It's alright, I guess.

568
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:32,680
Granny,

569
00:31:33,270 --> 00:31:34,790
your tea house is pretty big.

570
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:36,650
Can you handle it all by yourself?

571
00:31:36,840 --> 00:31:38,570
I have a granddaughter.

572
00:31:40,030 --> 00:31:40,480
Yeah,

573
00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:41,780
my granddaughter.

574
00:31:43,350 --> 00:31:44,000
Granny!

575
00:31:44,310 --> 00:31:46,350
Are the almond crisp
and pear blossom candy ready yet?

576
00:31:46,350 --> 00:31:47,940
The Li family's waiting!

577
00:31:48,110 --> 00:31:49,310
Look at my memory.

578
00:31:51,640 --> 00:31:52,320
Sir,

579
00:31:52,790 --> 00:31:54,240
I have to go out for a while.

580
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:55,830
If you need anything else,

581
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:57,320
j-just help yourself.

582
00:31:57,400 --> 00:32:00,110
The pastry prices are posted
right there on the counter.

583
00:32:00,110 --> 00:32:02,200
The poria cake will be ready in no time.

584
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:03,260
Don't go anywhere.

585
00:32:04,400 --> 00:32:04,930
Okay.

586
00:32:06,510 --> 00:32:08,000
Coming!

587
00:32:25,150 --> 00:32:30,480
[Letter of Ancestry Reclaiming
of Hengtang's Xie Family]

588
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:34,270
Dear.

589
00:32:35,350 --> 00:32:36,680
What are you looking at?

590
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:45,880
Granny.

591
00:32:46,830 --> 00:32:47,750
This is

592
00:32:48,030 --> 00:32:49,960
the invitation sent by the Xie family

593
00:32:49,960 --> 00:32:52,090
for the ancestry reclaiming banquet.

594
00:32:53,870 --> 00:32:56,090
[Letter of Ancestry Reclaiming
of Hengtang's Xie Family]

595
00:32:55,070 --> 00:32:56,270
They're inviting you

596
00:32:56,750 --> 00:32:58,440
to thank you for raising me.

597
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:07,630
Silly girl.

598
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:09,420
How could I go?

599
00:33:09,790 --> 00:33:11,720
It wouldn't look right if I went.

600
00:33:16,070 --> 00:33:17,920
Look at you, all listless.

601
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:19,200
Cheer up.

602
00:33:19,720 --> 00:33:21,650
You've still got a lot to attend to.

603
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:24,400
I have to go make a delivery.

604
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:26,660
Keep an eye on the customer inside for me.

605
00:33:56,270 --> 00:33:58,870
The jade soul inherits
the cold moon's spirit;

606
00:33:58,960 --> 00:34:01,290
white silk still wraps traces of the past.

607
00:34:01,750 --> 00:34:04,200
Let not the east wind sweep away
the snow before the steps,

608
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:08,060
for a hidden fragrance may yet drift out
from behind those deep gates.

609
00:34:08,230 --> 00:34:08,960
Tell me,

610
00:34:09,110 --> 00:34:11,230
do you think that tree out front
has buried beneath it

611
00:34:11,230 --> 00:34:14,830
a great many secrets that were
never meant to see the light of day?

612
00:34:19,110 --> 00:34:20,710
How cold of you.

613
00:34:22,590 --> 00:34:24,989
Don't tell me you've forgotten me already.

614
00:34:25,550 --> 00:34:27,000
Please forgive me, honored guest.

615
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:29,199
I've had a poor memory since childhood,

616
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:31,550
especially when it comes to
remembering people's faces.

617
00:34:31,550 --> 00:34:32,750
Please forgive me.

618
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:37,480
It's okay if you don't recognize me.

619
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,889
That white horse at Fushan Temple—

620
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:44,090
what was its name again?

621
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:45,840
Yunduo, right?

622
00:34:47,320 --> 00:34:48,590
What a beautiful name.

623
00:34:49,230 --> 00:34:51,360
Just as beautiful as your name, Yunya.

624
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:02,140
You don't like such praise, lady, do you?

625
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:05,000
Then what do you like to hear?

626
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:07,420
Exceptionally intelligent?

627
00:35:07,710 --> 00:35:09,040
Unmatched in strategy?

628
00:35:09,320 --> 00:35:10,280
Or maybe,

629
00:35:11,110 --> 00:35:13,800
your acting is so superb
that even Old Madam Xie

630
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:14,970
fell into your trap?

631
00:35:19,030 --> 00:35:21,030
Don't like the sound of that either?

632
00:35:22,920 --> 00:35:24,650
Then let me try something else.

633
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:29,000
Fugitive Dong Fangchun,

634
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:32,360
or fake Taoist Xin Zhen?

635
00:35:32,360 --> 00:35:33,760
Now that calamity has befallen you,

636
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:35,440
there is surely a mascot to ward it off.

637
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:36,850
So there is a solution?

638
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:43,370
What is Your Lordship's intention

639
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:45,240
in pressing me so aggressively?

640
00:35:45,550 --> 00:35:47,480
I should be the one asking you that.

641
00:35:48,280 --> 00:35:50,000
Why were you willing to stop at nothing—

642
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:52,200
even setting the Xie Residence on fire—

643
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,090
to enter the Xie family?

644
00:35:54,760 --> 00:35:56,280
I never set any fire.

645
00:35:57,880 --> 00:35:58,710
That's true.

646
00:35:59,110 --> 00:36:02,070
It indeed wasn't you, Fourth Lady
of the Xie family, who set the fire,

647
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:04,240
but Chen Yunya of Chen's Tea House.

648
00:36:10,150 --> 00:36:11,920
I just wonder if Granny Chen

649
00:36:12,630 --> 00:36:15,840
could withstand the punishment
for harboring a criminal.

650
00:36:15,840 --> 00:36:16,480
Yan Rui.

651
00:36:16,670 --> 00:36:17,800
Whatever you want, take it out on me.

652
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:18,700
Leave Granny out of this.

653
00:36:18,700 --> 00:36:19,380
Tell me,

654
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:22,690
what is your purpose for
entering the Xie family?

655
00:36:32,360 --> 00:36:34,110
I'm a daughter of the Xie family
to begin with.

656
00:36:34,110 --> 00:36:36,640
What's wrong with
me reclaiming my ancestry?

657
00:36:42,990 --> 00:36:46,190
If I hand over the evidence of your arson
to the Xie family,

658
00:36:46,550 --> 00:36:47,480
do you think

659
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:50,570
they'll believe you, a fake daughter,

660
00:36:51,630 --> 00:36:52,690
or me, an official?

661
00:36:59,440 --> 00:37:00,280
What,

662
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:01,900
you want to kill me?

663
00:37:03,150 --> 00:37:03,950
Go ahead then.

664
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:14,860
I'm back.

665
00:37:15,550 --> 00:37:17,220
Has the customer left?

666
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,150
Dear?

667
00:37:18,590 --> 00:37:19,320
I'm leaving.

668
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:25,320
From now on,

669
00:37:25,550 --> 00:37:26,810
I'll come visit often.

670
00:37:34,060 --> 00:37:36,630
[Hengtang]

671
00:37:38,470 --> 00:37:41,190
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

672
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:45,000
The Fourth Lady has arrived.

673
00:37:59,550 --> 00:38:00,150
Mother.

674
00:38:01,230 --> 00:38:01,920
Sorry that

675
00:38:03,070 --> 00:38:04,550
I didn't listen to you

676
00:38:05,520 --> 00:38:07,280
and chose to come back to

677
00:38:08,110 --> 00:38:10,840
the Xie family that caused you
so much suffering.

678
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:15,480
You always said that vengeance
only breeds more vengeance and never ends.

679
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:17,540
But in these grand mansions of power,

680
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:19,550
there is no such thing as reason,

681
00:38:19,550 --> 00:38:20,950
only victory and defeat.

682
00:38:21,630 --> 00:38:23,400
Now that the game has begun,

683
00:38:24,130 --> 00:38:27,270
it's time for me to make my move.

684
00:38:28,150 --> 00:38:28,960
In

685
00:38:29,150 --> 00:38:31,110
the eighth year of Jingxi,

686
00:38:31,190 --> 00:38:33,670
in accordance with
the order of heaven and earth

687
00:38:33,670 --> 00:38:35,400
and the harmony of Yin and Yang,

688
00:38:36,110 --> 00:38:37,940
it is the blessing of the family

689
00:38:38,840 --> 00:38:40,460
that the descendants

690
00:38:40,510 --> 00:38:44,080
always remember
the teachings of their ancestors.

691
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:46,480
[Xie Qinghe,
Eldest Lady of the Xie Family]

692
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:47,840
Now, the fourth daughter
of the Xie family,

693
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:48,980
[Xie Qingru,
Second Lady of the Xie Family]

694
00:38:48,070 --> 00:38:49,670
long separated from her kin

695
00:38:49,140 --> 00:38:51,670
[Xie Qingrong,
Third Lady of the Xie Family]

696
00:38:49,920 --> 00:38:52,320
and is currently 19 years old,

697
00:38:52,960 --> 00:38:54,670
is virtuous and well-mannered.

698
00:38:53,790 --> 00:38:55,900
[Lian Fanqiao,
Third Concubine of the Xie Family]

699
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:56,630
She honors her ancestors

700
00:38:56,920 --> 00:38:58,360
and spares no hardship

701
00:38:58,630 --> 00:39:00,900
to return to the Xie household.

702
00:39:01,230 --> 00:39:05,540
She shall be received as a daughter
under the care of Head Madam, Lady Hu,

703
00:39:02,630 --> 00:39:04,750
[Hu Wenzhuo,
Head Madam of the Xie Family]

704
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:08,020
[Old Madam Xie]

705
00:39:05,710 --> 00:39:08,360
inheriting the family lineage.

706
00:39:09,590 --> 00:39:11,670
She is now formally received
into the family,

707
00:39:11,670 --> 00:39:13,510
her birth name,

708
00:39:14,150 --> 00:39:16,190
Xie Qingyuan, restored,

709
00:39:14,190 --> 00:39:16,690
[Xie Qingyuan,
Fourth Lady of the Xie Family]

710
00:39:16,970 --> 00:39:19,800
[Qingyuan]

711
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:19,120
and entered into the genealogy.

712
00:39:20,150 --> 00:39:21,610
The ceremony is complete.

713
00:39:22,710 --> 00:39:24,510
Congratulations, Fourth Lady,

714
00:39:24,800 --> 00:39:26,150
on returning to the clan.

715
00:39:26,150 --> 00:39:28,760
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

716
00:39:26,510 --> 00:39:27,150
Mother,

717
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,000
this time,

718
00:39:29,760 --> 00:39:31,290
I swear I'll clear your name

719
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:33,840
and see justice done.
